"$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"When people work around the ERP, there is something to learn."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"A spreadsheet outside the system may point to an unclear report, an awkward workflow, missing training, or a genuine product gap. We investigate the cause before recommending another custom feature or a larger server."}]]}]]}],[null,null],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-chapters","children":[["$","$L12","Understand the system you have",{"as":"section","className":"story-chapter","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Understand the system you have"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"For an existing installation, we review the version, installed applications, customisations, integrations, data concerns, and hosting responsibilities. The output is a prioritised improvement plan."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"story-points","children":[["$","li","Existing-system and customisation review",{"children":"Existing-system and customisation review"}],["$","li","Issue classification by impact and urgency",{"children":"Issue classification by impact and urgency"}],["$","li","A practical sequence of fixes and improvements",{"children":"A practical sequence of fixes and improvements"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","$L12","Make support expectations explicit",{"as":"section","className":"story-chapter","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":"02"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Make support expectations explicit"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"The agreement defines how requests are raised, which hours are covered, how incidents are prioritised, and when escalation happens. Response targets and resolution expectations are discussed separately."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"story-points","children":[["$","li","Support channels and coverage",{"children":"Support channels and coverage"}],["$","li","Incident priorities and escalation contacts",{"children":"Incident priorities and escalation contacts"}],["$","li","Included work and separately quoted changes",{"children":"Included work and separately quoted changes"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","$L12","Change with evidence",{"as":"section","className":"story-chapter","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":"03"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Change with evidence"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"Updates and new features should be tested against the workflows the team depends on. We plan backups, a test environment where appropriate, release checks, and a rollback route before production changes."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"story-points","children":[["$","li","Compatibility checks and regression testing",{"children":"Compatibility checks and regression testing"}],["$","li","Backup and recovery responsibilities",{"children":"Backup and recovery responsibilities"}],["$","li","Training refreshers and a reviewed improvement backlog",{"children":"Training refreshers and a reviewed improvement backlog"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-outcomes","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"WHAT THIS MAKES POSSIBLE"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Better work, in practical terms."}],["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li","A clear place to raise and prioritise issues.",{"children":"A clear place to raise and prioritise issues."}],["$","li","Changes evaluated against the work they affect.",{"children":"Changes evaluated against the work they affect."}],["$","li","An ERP that can evolve with the people using it.",{"children":"An ERP that can evolve with the people using it."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-section","aria-labelledby":"questions-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"BEFORE WE BEGIN"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"questions-heading","className":"t-h2","children":"Good questions. Clear answers."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-faq","children":[["$","details","Can you support a system implemented by someone else?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Can you support a system implemented by someone else?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We can assess an existing installation for takeover. Access, source availability, version compatibility, custom work, and unresolved issues determine the transition plan and scope."}]]}],["$","details","Are upgrades and new features included?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Are upgrades and new features included?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Included maintenance, version upgrades, functional support, and development are listed in the agreement. A new feature request is assessed against that scope before work begins."}]]}],["$","details","Can hosting be included?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Can hosting be included?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Yes, hosting can be discussed with NestCloud. The proposal should make application support, infrastructure operations, backups, and incident ownership clear."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"id":"enquiry","children":["$","section",null,{"className":"story-enquiry","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"YOUR NEXT CHAPTER"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Start with what needs to work better."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Tell us where things stand, what is getting in the way, and what you want to achieve. We can shape the next step from there."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-actions","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"btn btn-primary","href":"mailto:info@nsd-eg.com?subject=Keep%20the%20system%20useful%20as%20the%20business%20changes.","children":["Discuss your existing ERP"," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"↗"}]]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"story-textlink","href":"tel:+201021965445","children":["Prefer a call? ","+2010 2196 5445"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-related","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"CONNECTED THROUGH NEST"}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/onespace","children":"Business operations ↗"}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/miravoice","children":"Business communications ↗"}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/nestcloud","children":"Cloud & hosting ↗"}]]}]]]}]}],null]}]
